    "slug": "recovered-instincts",
    "description": "<p>The user has reawakened the survival instincts they once required in the ancient past.</p><p>The user may learn any one move from the @Trait[fossil] Tutor List, and may learn two other Moves from any of their Tutor Lists, up to their Grade.</p><p>The user has a +10 bonus to Skill Checks, their Attacks have +15% Accuracy, and they have a 30% chance to gain @Affliction[advance 20] upon resolving an Attack or Action, when hit by a super effective Attack or Critical Hit, or when they gain a @Trait[major-affliction] or @Trait[negative-stage-change] effect.</p>",
